{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音上之伊，下之耶，實〔嘆〕嘆之音也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出元曉師《金光明記》及小論說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
