{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音徒，改實近幾也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音二并胡占，實福也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音許兩，實鄉人飲食，今此中訓\n云資也也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音二并向，實應也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音烋光，實明也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音賢映，實盛光也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音寶厭，伯履"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音上敷雲，實香和，又木香分布。下音力誓，實光也、美也。應作烈字，裂非此用字，此如衣割也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上音于鬼。《說文》云：「盛\n明㒵、赤㒵。」次音華實"}
